                    ABOUT THE ROLE



This is an exciting opportunity for an experienced Sales coordinator in the baby & pet industry to join our dynamic and growing team. 



Reporting to the General Manager, this permanent full-time position will play a critical role in supporting the sales and marketing function of the brand.



The position will include a range of tasks and duties, including but not limited to the following areas:



Day-to-day sales coordination and administration, account management and business development;

Development and implementation of sales and marketing strategies across different channels;

Assistance with forecasting, planning, sales analysis and stock management;

Trade marketing management, including 3rd party merchandiser co-ordination and customer liaison;

Assistance with DTC management, including offer development and co-ordination, customer enquiry management, and sales performance analysis.

SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE



To be successful in this role, you will possess:



A proven track record in developing and implementing marketing and sales strategies, and delivering successful results;

Ability to build and grow strong relationships and exceptional customer service skills;

Ability to be hands on and high level of attention to details;

Good organisational, planning, time management skills;

Strong understanding of digital media principles to help drive digital strategies and experience in development and implementation of DTC marketing strategies;

Proficiency in common computer software required by the role;

Confident, reliable, honest and a team player.

Remuneration will be commensurate with experience and performance.

